    alias: hardcoreerik
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Garthnesss/chemspec-workbench
abstract: >
  Software-only UV-Vis/IR spectrum workbench with shared spectrum_core.
  Opens CSV/JCAMP, plots, measures peaks with an explicit FWHM/area
  contract, corrects baselines, overlays and folder waterfalls, and
  exports publication figures. Does not identify compounds.
keywords:
  - spectroscopy
  - UV-Vis
  - infrared
  - peak measurement
  - reproducible analysis
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
